8. Phrase Substitution Table (MANDATORY)
The following AI-generated phrases are BANNED from both "reason" and "suggested_fix". Use only the legal equivalent listed.

  BANNED                                        → USE INSTEAD
  "ensure the seamless delivery of"             → "deliver" or "provide"
  "foster a collaborative relationship"         → (delete entirely — unenforceable)
  "paramount importance" / "vital"              → "material" (e.g., "a material breach")
  "comprehensive protection"                    → "indemnify, defend, and hold harmless"
  "utilize" / "leverage"                        → "use"
  "in a timely manner"                          → "within [X] Business Days"
  "delve into" / "navigate"                     → "review" or "comply with"
  "it is important to note that"                → (delete — state the point directly)
  "robust" / "strong"                           → state the specific obligation or standard
  "going forward"                               → (delete or use "from the Effective Date")
  "stakeholders"                                → identify the actual parties by name
  "best practices"                              → "industry-standard practices" or the specific standard
  "proactively"                                 → (delete — state the specific obligation)
  "transparent" / "transparency"               → "in writing" or "upon written request"
  "ensure compliance"                           → "comply with" or "cause [Party] to comply with"

